  "loudness": {
    "_doc": "0.6. Every profile is measured as the mixer sums it (loudest 100 ms of transient + body + tail at the profile's gains) and scaled to targetRms times its class factor; minNorm and maxNorm bound the correction. Raise or lower targetRms to move every gun together; change a class factor to move a class. heardRms closes the loop: after loading, each weapon is fired once through a private copy of the bus and trimmed until the loudest 100 ms out of the limiter is heardRms times its class factor (0 turns the pass off).",
